# NOTE (M-27, 2026-08-10): gradlew / gradlew.bat / gradle-wrapper.jar are
# deliberately NOT ignored anymore — they are committed so CI builds are
# deterministic (M-21 handoff). They were removed from the Flutter template's
# default ignore list; flutter_tools auto-injects them when missing, but a
# committed wrapper removes the regeneration dependency.

